### Test NewsFeed Analytics
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/analytics
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test NewsFeed Basic
GET https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Admin Posts
GET https://localhost:8443/api/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test NewsFeed Initialize
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/initialize
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Cleanup Old Items
POST https://localhost:8443/api/newsfeed/admin/cleanup-old-items?daysToKeep=30
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

